<p dir="auto">Automatically injects styles into the DOM using multiple <code>&lt;style&gt;&lt;/style&gt;</code>. It is the <strong>default</strong> behaviour.</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>component.js</strong></p>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-js notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" dir="auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="import &quot;./styles.css&quot;;"><pre><span class="pl-k">import</span> <span class="pl-s">"./styles.css"</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span></pre></div>
